{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11203250","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11203250","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1120325001:1":{"text":"빨리 돌아왔군. 그렇다면 어디 보자…","source_cn":"竟然这么快就把蜘蛛蛋带回来了。让我看看……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x619CD272945F029B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120325002:1":{"text":"맞아, 바로 이거야! 이 매력적인 색상, 완벽한 모양, 그리고 환상적인 냄새…","source_cn":"没错，我想要的就是这个！这种绝妙的色泽，完美的形状，还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7EF118E8BDA3AC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120325003:1":{"text":"보기만 해도 군침이 도는군.","source_cn":"我的口水都要掉下来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED2D789311CEEAE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120325004:1":{"text":"저기… 저 미어캣이 보고 있는 게 우리가 구해 온 거미알이 맞는 거겠지?","source_cn":"这……难道我们和狐獴们看到的不是同一个蜘蛛蛋吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC90CEEE144B07BA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120325005:1":{"text":"이해는 안 가지만… 그래도 입맛은 존중해 주자.","source_cn":"虽然我也不理解……但姑且尊重口味的多样性吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x741C80BB2F3B672A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120325006:1":{"text":"오케이, 사례는 이걸로 충분해. 다들 정말 고마워!","source_cn":"好嘞，报酬我已经都收好了。真的太感谢各位了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B41E1C054256407","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120325007:1":{"text":"아니요, 저희가 오히려 고맙죠. 도와주셔서 고맙습니다!","source_cn":"不不不，应该是我们谢你才对……谢谢你帮了我们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x755C0AB0DE071C06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120325008:1":{"text":"아이고, 이 정도 갖고 뭘~ 또 도움이 필요하면 언제든지 찾아오시길!","source_cn":"嗨呀，这些都是小事。如果你们下次还有什么要帮忙的，随时...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B8E0F3D1E01B0F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120325009:1":{"text":"물론 사례는 거미알이라는 걸 잊지 말고!","source_cn":"当然，报酬还可以是蜘蛛蛋！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23B8FA2660CCFA58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1120325009":{"text":"물론 사례는 거미알이라는 걸 잊지 말고!","source_cn":"当然，报酬还可以是蜘蛛蛋！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23B8FA2660CCFA58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120325010:1":{"text":"하하, 시간이 늦었군. 나도 슬슬 돌아가야겠어!","source_cn":"哈哈，时候不早了，我也差不多该准备离开了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x669DC02E1AFB0E4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120325011:1":{"text":"아, 이 포션은 선물로 드리지.","source_cn":"对了，这瓶药剂，是送给你们的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x559499D8FFB3C7F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120325012:1":{"text":"이건… 지난번의 그 포션인가요?","source_cn":"这个是……和之前一样的那种药剂？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0B1D9C6CEA00321","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1120325013:1":{"text":"맞아. 기본적인 중독을 치료할 수 있을 거야. 뒀다가 급할 때 써.","source_cn":"嗯，这种药剂可以治疗一些基础的中毒。你们留着以备不时之需吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x194E0E939F46878D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1120325014:1":{"text":"귀한 포션일 텐데, 정말로 저희한테 주시는 건가요?","source_cn":"这个很贵重吧？真的可以送给我们吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x869D0DF837AD4DC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1120325015:1":{"text":"이미 많이 도와주셨는데, 이렇게 선물까지 주시니… 정말 감사해서 어떻게 해야 할지…","source_cn":"你帮了我们这么多，还送东西……感觉不太好意思收来着……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3DB831C51A5B272","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1120325016:1":{"text":"신경 쓰지 마. 그냥 작별 선물이라고 생각해.","source_cn":"没事，就当是我给你们的送别礼吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0673FB693C7FECFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1120325017:1":{"text":"다만 특별한 포션을 원한다면, 적당한 물건으로 바꾸는 걸로 하지. 전갈은 어때?","source_cn":"不过如果你们还想要更特别的药剂，之后就要用别的东西来换...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x224DAF58D8B5CB06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1120325018:1":{"text":"전, 전, 전갈이요?! 미어캣의 입맛은 참 특이하네요. 전갈을 먹다니!","source_cn":"蝎、蝎、蝎子！你们狐獴吃的东西也太奇怪了吧，竟然还吃蝎子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x709C764375677961","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1120325019:1":{"text":"우리 미어캣에게 있어 전갈의 독은 맛을 돋우는 양념 정도라고 보면 돼. 거미알처럼 그 식감과 맛이 끝내주거든.","source_cn":"对我们狐獴来说，蝎子可一点毒素都没有，反而味道鲜美，就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA391291B50C742E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:25:1120325019":{"text":"우리 미어캣에게 있어 전갈의 독은 맛을 돋우는 양념 정도라고 보면 돼. 거미알처럼 그 식감과 맛이 끝내주거든.","source_cn":"对我们狐獴来说，蝎子可一点毒素都没有，反而味道鲜美，就和蜘蛛蛋一样，是一道美味佳肴哦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA391291B50C742E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1120325020:1":{"text":"그러니까! 상상만 해도 속이...","source_cn":"没错！光是想象自己要吃这种东西，我就已经不舒服起来了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CC62C8AED6F2980","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1120325021:1":{"text":"아무튼! 나중에 기회가 된다면 독이 없는 녀석으로 대접하지!","source_cn":"以后有机会的话，你们可以尝尝看，我给你们做个无毒版本的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B0A10B12A570E6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1120325022:1":{"text":"사양할게요.","source_cn":"不必了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC83D2D1382D0725","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1120325023:1":{"text":"아쉽군! 난 이만 가볼 테니, 나중에 또 보자고!","source_cn":"真是可惜！那么我就先走了，各位，有缘再见了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE57621893E9C76B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:25:0:1":{"text":"미어캣은 정말 다양한 걸 먹네…","source_cn":"你们狐獴的菜单还真是丰富……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0703185869CECC40","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"미어캣은 정말 다양한 걸 먹네…","female":"미어캣은 정말 다양한 걸 먹네…","variant_male_r